\title{KNN.normalization: Neighbor-Based Normalization of CITE-Seq Protein Data}
\description{
KNN normalization is a normalization method for protein counts in CITE-seq data. It learns from neighbor cells in a k-nearest-neighbor (KNN) graph in order to estimate the appropriate total protein counts in each cell, accurately estimating total protein counts while preserving biological information. This package works on 'Seurat' objects and is the R counterpart of the Python package 'KNN_normalization', which is based on 'scanpy'.
}
